# Backend (apps/back)

Read **`.agents/skills/nestjs-best-practices/SKILL.md`**. Load **`rules/<topic>.md`** as needed; **`GUIDE.md`** only for a full audit (not loaded by default).

- Organize by **feature modules**; constructor injection; no service locator.
- Validate all input with DTOs + global `ValidationPipe` (`whitelist`, `transform`).
- Auth via guards; throw `HttpException` subclasses with **actionable** messages (shown in the Nuxt UI).
- MikroORM migrations for schema changes; transactions for multi-step writes.
- Response DTOs / `@Exclude()` — never leak entities raw.

Error messages consumed by the frontend should follow geist-design copy (what happened + what to do next).
